***conformance tests***

# package-names
The `plain_parser` package has every name of its `__all__` list in :PythonApi:, and `plain_parser.plain_file_parser` parses `valid.plain`.

# console-script
Running `plain-parser check valid.plain` as a process exits with code 0, writes standard output ending in `: OK` and a newline, and writes nothing on standard error.

***acceptance tests***
